# Site context

Personal site of Gervis Bermudez. Jekyll 4.4.1 + Liquid. Static HTML/CSS/JS. Visual theme is Arter exported from WordPress/Elementor (`art-*`, `elementor-*` classes). CSS overrides live only in `public/css/styles.css`.

## Deploy

- Local (`_config.yml`): `url` and `baseurl` empty. Serve: `bundle exec jekyll serve`
- Prod (`_config_prod.yml`): `url=https://gervisbermudez.github.io` `baseurl=/site`. Live: https://gervisbermudez.github.io/site
- CI: push `main` → `bundle exec jekyll build --config _config_prod.yml` → `_site` to `gh-pages`

## Layout

- Pages: `index.html`, `about-me/`, `contact/`, `portfolio/`, `blog/`
- Posts: `_posts/`. Portfolio: `_data/portfolio.yml` + `portfolio/<slug>/index.html`
- Shared chrome: `_layouts/default.html`, `_includes/side.html`, `_includes/menu.html`

## Voice

English copy. Keep `<html lang="es">` and `og:locale es_ES`. Do not translate the site.

## Do not

- Convert to Next/React
- Delete or rewrite Arter markup, `public/themes/arter/**`, or `public/plugins/**`
- Hardcode `/site` in links (use `| relative_url` / `| absolute_url`)
- Commit or regenerate `_site/` as source
